<title>USA: BellSouth to buy 49 pct Nicaraguan carrier - paper.</title>
<headline>BellSouth to buy 49 pct Nicaraguan carrier - paper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BellSouth Corp plans to buy 49 percent of Nicaragua's only cellular phone carrier, Nicacel, USA Today reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>The report said BellSouth will pay about $20 million for the investment, which is to be finalised this week.</p>
<p>The company could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
